WEBVTT

00:01:59.316 --> 00:02:01.596
Perhaps we were in a hurry.

00:02:02.676 --> 00:02:08.316
Many of us have a feeling
that we are running out of time.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:12.796
But when we rush to do something,

00:02:12.836 --> 00:02:15.516
are we saving time

00:02:15.516 --> 00:02:17.116
or are we losing it?

00:02:24.116 --> 00:02:27.836
There is a lot that is urgent,

00:02:27.876 --> 00:02:32.836
but in order to take
the kind of radical, decisive action